config MI_MEMPOOL
	tristate "MI_MEMPOOL page reserve pool (rodin blob rebuild)"
	default n
	help
	  Preserve page pools served to whitelisted core processes on memory
	  allocation failures or direct-reclaim throttle.  Rebuilt against the
	  rodin device blob; sysfs: /sys/kernel/mi_mempool/{pids,config,
	  direct_reclaim_threshold_mb,general_stat_info,process_use_count}.
